StickyNote {
 inputs 0
 name StickyNote1
 label "Scene (g) -- banding on a receding ground plane\n\nCheck: an opaque ground plane receding continuously through focus must show no visible seams at bucket boundaries at K=16; compare K=8 vs K=64.\n\nTop row: three DeepCDefocus branches off the same OPAQUE ground-plane source, depth_layers=8/16/64 (16 is the shipping default). That is the harness's g1/g2/g3 and the scene's own stated criterion, and it PASSES -- the worst row-to-row seam is 3.9e-05 against the 1/255 an 8-bit view resolves.\n\nBottom row: the SAME ramp at alpha < 1, which is where the residual is. Both branches are documented XFAILs in the harness and neither reads its input alpha back -- see their own note."
 note_font_size 14
 xpos 300
}
Constant {
 inputs 0
 color {0.36 0.495 0.63 0.9}
 format "256 256 0 0 256 256 1 deepc_val_256"
 name Constant2
}
Expression {
 channel0 depth
 expr0 1.0/(1720.000000/(300.0-y))
 name Expression2
}
DeepFromImage {
 name DeepFromImage2
 label "same ramp, alpha 0.90"
 xpos -220
 ypos 320
}
DeepCDefocus {
 coc_mode Manual
 size 86
 name DeepCDefocus4
 label "K=16, expect a flat 0.90"
 xpos -220
 ypos 440
}
